+## Read-only cell effect template (SCHEMA fields/). Durations use combat ticks.
+extends SerializableData
+class_name FieldData
+
+enum FACTION_FILTERS {ANY, PARTY, ENEMY, ALLY_OF_OWNER, OPPONENT_OF_OWNER}
